 *               (MIT, (c) 2023 Canonn Research Group)
 *               https://github.com/canonn-science/canonn-signals
 *
 * Permit locks are published in no game data file or API, so this is a
 * hand-maintained community list and is best-effort.
 *
 * Each entry is a region name in hand-authored-regions.jsonc and also the
 * whole-token prefix of every system name inside that region. Permit-locked
 * bodies inside otherwise-open systems (e.g. Diso 5 C, Lave 2) are out of scope.
 *
 * Full provenance and derivation notes: data/astro/SOURCES.md.
 */
